            <p>☆4</p>
            <p > - Ramen Belly is located at 1010 Martin St, Iowa City, IA 52245 and opened back in 2021. They are a Japanese restaurant, with main dishes being Ramen, and rice bowls. A favorite appetizer of ours is their pot stickers. One order comes with 4 pot stickers, a side of cucumbers and topped off in a sauce.</p>
